      "type": "text",
      "x": 1932.753906250001,
      "y": 2460.377604166666,
      "width": 691.1999999999999,
      "height": 54,
      "text": "• Distributes storage + writes\n• Each shard = fraction of load\n• Linear: 2x shards ≈ 2x capacity",
